	whenever (for that channel):
	<ul>
	<li>recorded data becomes newly available for collection by
fnref	sm_get_recorded_data
	<li>
	recorded data remains available for collection by
fnref	sm_get_recorded_data
	<li>recording terminates due to one of the termination
	criteria being met</li>
	</ul>
	<p>
	The channel is reserved for recording until
fnref	sm_record_status
